<title>TAIWAN: TAIWAN SUGAR TO TENDER 30,000T OF U.S. CORN/SOY.</title>
<headline>TAIWAN SUGAR TO TENDER 30,000T OF U.S. CORN/SOY.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Wednesday for a combined shipment of 20,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			  U.S. Gulf    Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn    20,000     Sep 16-30    Oct 1-15</p>
<p> Soybean 10,000     Sep 16-30    Oct 1-15</p>
